{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Burakku Jakku Samurai</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/7515e5bd9abaa117b1ee16b463285dbf.poster.avif?t=1772887348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/7515e5bd9abaa117b1ee16b463285dbf.webm?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/7515e5bd9abaa117b1ee16b463285dbf.mp4?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Deck is Your Blade. Your Life is the Wager.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Burakku Jakku Samurai</strong> fuses the high-stakes tension of <strong>Blackjack</strong> with the lethality of samurai duels. You are a ronin on the razor's edge: a bad hand doesn't just break you, <strong>it kills you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/c4bd1cf4f585fec966c978a95056df0c.poster.avif?t=1772887348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/c4bd1cf4f585fec966c978a95056df0c.webm?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/c4bd1cf4f585fec966c978a95056df0c.mp4?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Duel: Steel Meets Chance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/5ff8a3e8cb81e95facf3ea9214fdea3f.poster.avif?t=1772887348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/5ff8a3e8cb81e95facf3ea9214fdea3f.webm?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/5ff8a3e8cb81e95facf3ea9214fdea3f.mp4?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget casino luck. Here, every card is a sword strike.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your KI:</strong> Drawing close to 21 charges your spiritual energy. Do you stand to defend, or risk one more card to unleash a <strong>Critical Strike</strong>?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the Rules:</strong> Honor is vital, but survival is paramount. Use <strong>Forbidden Techniques</strong> to alter card values, stun opponents, or twist the fate of the hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sudden Death:</strong> The AI shows no mercy. Calculate the risk. A <strong>Bust</strong> is a clean cut to the jugular.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/3a180a3134ac99a85d709aafd35f9d23.poster.avif?t=1772887348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/3a180a3134ac99a85d709aafd35f9d23.webm?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/3a180a3134ac99a85d709aafd35f9d23.mp4?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the Ronin's Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes:</strong> Experience a narrative <strong>Campaign</strong> of redemption or test your endurance in the endless <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Arsenal:</strong> Master over <strong>20 Skills</strong> (active and passive) that transform classic Blackjack into deep strategic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lethal Pixel Art:</strong> Fluid animations turn every match into a scene from a samurai film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Traverse the map, defeat unique bosses, and adapt your skill deck after every victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/9f30c9a271aa763cbe85e6293b2b6c99.poster.avif?t=1772887348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/9f30c9a271aa763cbe85e6293b2b6c99.webm?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/9f30c9a271aa763cbe85e6293b2b6c99.mp4?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Burakku Jakku Samurai reinvents the card classic into a fight to the death. Easy to learn, brutal to master, and highly addictive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have the nerve to win the hand?</strong> Add to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"