ital, but survival is paramount. Use <strong>Forbidden Techniques</strong> to alter card values, stun opponents, or twist the fate of the hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sudden Death:</strong> The AI shows no mercy. Calculate the risk. A <strong>Bust</strong> is a clean cut to the jugular.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/3a180a3134ac99a85d709aafd35f9d23.poster.avif?t=1772887348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/3a180a3134ac99a85d709aafd35f9d23.webm?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/extras/3a180a3134ac99a85d709aafd35f9d23.mp4?t=1772887348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of the Ronin's Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes:</strong> Experience a narrative <strong>Campaign</strong> of redemption or test your endurance in the endless <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Arsenal:</strong> Master over <strong>20 Skills</strong> (active and passive) that transform classic Blackjack into deep strategic combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lethal Pixel Art:</strong> Fluid animations turn every match into a scene from a samurai film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Traverse the map, defeat unique bosses, and adapt your skill deck after every victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\