48","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/de8a279f4153fc2028eeb07829189df9eb98e33a/ss_de8a279f4153fc2028eeb07829189df9eb98e33a.600x338.jpg?t=1772887348"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/6a320986c49c57e8cdb57858616381ae5901f003/ss_6a320986c49c57e8cdb57858616381ae5901f003.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772887348","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/6a320986c49c57e8cdb57858616381ae5901f003/ss_6a320986c49c57e8cdb57858616381ae5901f003.600x338.jpg?t=1772887348"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/4018a1ee89d62a023b25a1641f5a16a73f179c5a/ss_4018a1ee89d62a023b25a1641f5a16a73f179c5a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772887348","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784470/4018a1ee89d62a023b25a1641f5a16a73f179c5a/ss_4018a1ee89d62a023b25a1641f5a16a73f179c5a.600x338.jpg?t=1772887348"}],"short_description":"Do you have the nerve to survive? A unique fusion of Samurai Duels and Blackjack. Forget the casino: here, you play against killers. Use your Ki to alter cards, adapt your strategy each round, and conquer a perilous story mode. No luck, just steel and calculation. Your deck is your blade.","steam_appid":3784470,"support_info":{"email":"riojagames55@gmail.com","url":"https://burakkujakkugame.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain, Catalan","type":"game","website":"https://burakkujakkugame.com/"}